HybridAdvantages and disadvantages
How convenient are hybrid cars?
Hybrid cars ensure various benefits, specifically for those
who do not want or cannot opt for pure electric.
● The main advantages of hybrid cars are:
● Wide range of models to choose from;
● Different hybrid technologies for every need;
● Reduced emissions and consumption compared to
only ICE ones;
● No limitation of range compared to electric;
● Various benefits available.
